{"sourceUrl":"https://ic.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0903/c19738a601773/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:05.331050+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ic.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0903/c19738a601773/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><span>为做好</span><span>2027</span><span>年推荐免试硕士研究生工作，根据相关文件要求，通知如下。</span></p><p><strong><span>一、报名条件</span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>．</span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>．本校、外校</span><span>2027</span><span>年本科优秀应届毕业生</span><span>，必须获得本科所在学校的推免资格</span><span>;</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>．外语要求：</span></p><p><span>·</span><span>英语须符合以下任一项：</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）通过全国大学英语六级考试（六级成绩</span><span>425</span><span>分及以上）或通过全国大学英语四级考试且成绩为优秀（四级成绩</span><span>550</span><span>分及以上）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>成绩</span><span>90</span><span>分（</span><span>120</span><span>分制）及以上或</span><span>4.5</span><span>分（</span><span>6</span><span>分制）及以上；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）</span><span>IELTS</span><span>（</span><span>A</span><span>类</span><span>/</span><span>学术类）成绩</span><span>6</span><span>分及以上；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）</span><span>GRE</span><span>成绩在</span><span>310</span><span>以上，</span><span>GMAT</span><span>成绩在</span><span>640</span><span>以上；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）英语专业四级（及以上）考试合格。</span></p><p><span>·</span><span>小语种应达到以下对应标准：</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）日语要求日本语能力测试</span><span>N1</span><span>合格或日语专业四级合格；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）俄语要求俄语专业四级合格；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）法语要求法语专业四级考试合格或法语</span><span>DEFL/DALF</span><span>考试达到</span><span>C1</span><span>级；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）德语要求德语专业四级考试合格或德福考试成绩</span><span>19</span><span>～</span><span>20</span><span>分，或</span><span>TELC</span><span>以及歌德德语水平测试达到</span><span>C1</span><span>级。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>具有良好的学术科研潜力和明确的学术科研志向。</span><span><span>                                </span></span><span><span>     </span></span></p><p><strong><span>二、申请专业</span></strong></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>专业名称及代码</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>研究方向码</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>研究方向名称</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>可接收本科所属学科专业代码及名称</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>120500</span><span>信息资源管理</span></p></td><td><p><span>00</span></p></td><td><p><span>不区分研究方向</span></p></td><td><p><span>1. </span><span>经济学门类</span></p><p><span>0201</span><span>经济学类、</span><span>0202</span><span>财政学类、</span><span>0203</span><span>金融学类、</span><span>0204</span><span>经济与贸易类</span></p><p><span>2. </span><span>管理学门类</span></p><p><span>1201</span><span>管理科学与工程类、</span><span>1202</span><span>工商管理类、</span><span>1203</span><span>农业经济管理类、</span><span>1204</span><span>公共管理类、</span><span>1205</span><span>图书情报与档案管理类、</span><span>1206</span><span>物流管理与工程类、</span><span>1207</span><span>工业工程类、</span><span>1208</span><span>电子商务类、</span><span>1209</span><span>旅游管理类</span></p><p><span>3. </span><span>法学门类</span></p><p><span>0301</span><span>法学类、</span><span>0302</span><span>政治学类、</span><span>0303</span><span>社会学类</span></p><p><span>4. </span><span>教育学门类</span></p><p><span>0401</span><span>教育学类</span></p><p><span>5. </span><span>文学门类</span></p><p><span>050105</span><span>古典文献学、</span><span>050107T</span><span>秘书学、</span><span>0503</span><span>新闻传播学类</span></p><p><span>6. </span><span>历史学门类</span></p><p><span>0601</span><span>历史学类</span></p><p><span>7. </span><span>理学门类</span></p><p><span>0711</span><span>心理学类、</span><span>0712</span><span>统计学类</span></p><p><span>8. </span><span>工学门类</span></p><p><span>0809</span><span>计算机类</span></p><p><span>9. </span><span>医学门类</span></p><p><span>1004</span><span>公共卫生与预防医学类</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>125500</span><span>