>物流管理与工程类、</span><span>1207</span><span>工业工程类、</span><span>1208</span><span>电子商务类、</span><span>1209</span><span>旅游管理类</span></p><p><span>3. </span><span>法学门类</span></p><p><span>0301</span><span>法学类、</span><span>0302</span><span>政治学类、</span><span>0303</span><span>社会学类</span></p><p><span>4. </span><span>教育学门类</span></p><p><span>0401</span><span>教育学类</span></p><p><span>5. </span><span>文学门类</span></p><p><span>0501</span><span>中国语言文学类、</span><span>0502</span><span>外国语言文学类</span><span><span>0503</span></span><span>新闻传播学类</span></p><p><span>6. </span><span>历史学门类</span></p><p><span>0601</span><span>历史学类</span></p><p><span>7. </span><span>理学门类</span></p><p><span>0711</span><span>心理学类、</span><span>0712</span><span>统计学类</span></p><p><span>8. </span><span>工学门类</span></p><p><span>0809</span><span>计算机类</span></p><p><span>9. </span><span>医学门类</span></p><p><span>1004</span><span>公共卫生与预防医学类</span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span>059901</span><span>数智社会与新闻传播</span></p></td><td><p><span>01</span></p></td><td><p><span>数智传播</span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span>1. </span><span>经济学门类</span></p><p><span>0201</span><span>经济学类、</span><span>0202</span><span>财政学类、</span><span>0203</span><span>金融学类、</span><span>0204</span><span>经济与贸易类</span></p><p><span>2. </span><span>管理学门类</span></p><p><span>1201</span><span>管理科学与工程类、</span><span>1202</span><span>工商管理类、</span><span>1203</span><span>农业经济管理类、</span><span>1204</span><span>公共管理类、</span><span>1205</span><span>图书情报与档案管理类、</span><span>1206</span><span>物流管理与工程类、</span><span>1207</span><span>工业工程类、</span><span>1208</span><span>电子商务类、</span><span>1209</span><span>旅游管理类</span></p><p><span>3. </span><span>法学门类</span></p><p><span>0301</span><span>法学类、</span><span>0302</span><span>政治学类、</span><span>0303</span><span>社会学类</span></p><p><span>4. </span><span>教育学门类</span></p><p><span>0401</span><span>教育学类</span></p><p><span>5. </span><span>文学门类</span></p><p><span>0501</span><span>中国语言文学类、</span><span>0502</span><span>外国语言文学类</span><span><span>0503</span></span><span>新闻传播学类</span></p><p><span>6. </span><span>历史学门类</span></p><p><span>0601</span><span>历史学类</span></p><p><span>7. </span><span>理学门类</span></p><p><span>0711</span><span>心理学类、</span><span>0712</span><span>统计学类</span></p><p><span>8. </span><span>工学门类</span></p><p><span>0809</span><span>计算机类</span></p><p><span>9. </span><span>医学门类</span></p><p><span>1004</span><span>公共卫生与预防医学类</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>02</span></p></td><td><p><span>国际新闻与传播</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>03</span></p></td><td><p><span>融合出版</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>三、申请方式及流程</span></strong></p><p><span>（一）网上报名</span></p><p><span>南开大学研究生报名系统网址：</span><span>http://yzxt.nankai.edu.cn/intern/frontend/web/ </span><span><span>，每位申请人限报一个专业及研究方向，不可重复报名。</span><strong><span>截止时间为</span></strong></span><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>8</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>24:00</span></strong><span>，逾期不再接受申请。</span></p><p><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>12:00</span></strong><strong><span>前</span></strong><span><span>，请按以下顺序将报名材料扫描制成</span><strong><span>一个</span></strong></span><strong><span> PDF</span></strong><strong><span>文档</span></strong><span>，材料命名格式为</span><span>“</span><span>本科院校</span><span>-</span><span>姓名</span><span>-</span><span>报考专业</span><span>-</span><span>研究方向</span><span>”</span><span>，无需附封面和目录，发送到：</span><span>https://send2me.cn/a0IiWj1t/SYKpoFhKiheRBw</span><span>。逾期未提交材料及未按要求提交材料，报名无效。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）南开大学信息与传播学院推免生申请表（见附件）；</span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）南开大学研究生报名系统导出的信息表（须本人签字）；（</span><span>3</span><span>）身份证原件扫描件；（</span><span>4</span><span>）本科学生证原件扫描件；（</span><span>5</span><span>）</span><span>本科所有科目成绩单原件扫描件及在本专业排名证明（或在成绩单上空白处注明）原件扫描件</span><span>（注：成绩与排名需加盖校级或院级教务部门公章）；</span><span>（</span><span>6</span><span>）符合接收要求的外语成绩证明；（</span><span>7</span><span>）科研成果证明（可选项）。</span></p><p><span><span>南开大学研究生报名系统</span><strong><span>不能替代</span></strong><span>教育部推免服务系统，即便通过南开大学研究生系统报名的学生还需要在</span></span><span>“</span><span>教育部推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>中报名。凡是没有通过</span><span>“</span><span>教育部推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>报名的学生推荐免试一律无效。</span></p><p><span>（二）学院审核</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>．学院将对网申学生进行审核，通过者将接到邮件通知，未通过者不再专门通知。请报名时务必准确填写电子邮箱和手机号码，并及时查看、回复。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>．目前请考生网上报名，不需寄送材料。</span></p><p><span>（三）考核</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>．考核将采用线下的方式，具体安排和相关要求通过学院官网或电子邮件通知，预计为</span><span>9</span><span>月中下旬。请及时关注并保持邮件联络畅通，并请提前做好准备。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>．现场材料审查</span><span>:</span><span>考核当天将现场审查考生的身份证、学生证、外语成绩证明等信息原件，审核是否为本人、是否达到外语要求等信息。核对后返还原件。</span></p><p><strong><span>四、录取</span></strong></p><p><span>学院会根据考核成绩，</span><span>择优确定学院</span><span>2027</span><span>年推荐免试硕士研究生候选人，名额将以当年学校分配指标为准。</span></p><p><strong><span>五、联系方式</span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>．</span><span>本通知内容与上级教育主管部门日后下达文件不符的，以上级教育主管部门下达的最新文件为准。</span></p><p><span>南开大学信息与传播学院：</span><span>http://ic.nankai.edu.cn/ </span></p><p><span>南开大学研究生招生网：</span><span>http://yzb.nankai.edu.cn/ </span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span><span>．</span><span></span></span></span><span>咨询电话：</span><span><a href=\"mailto:022-85358748%EF%BC%88%E7%96%AB%E6%83%85%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E9%81%87%E7%94%B5%E8%AF%9D%E6%9C%AA%E6%8E%A5%E5%90%AC%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%91%E9%82%AE%E4%BB%B6%E8%87%B3nkxwzs@163.com%E9%97%AE%E8%AF%A2%EF%BC%89\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>022-85358748</span></a></span></p><p><span>3</span><span>．邮箱：</span><span><a href=\"mailto:jczs@nankai.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>jczs@nankai.edu.cn</span></a></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>   </span></span></p><p><span>南开大学信息与传播学院</span></p><p><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>3</span><span>日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ic.nankai.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://ic.nankai.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/c2/c1/94a44eef4ecbbfa2320d8d02f25e/bab6f051-3219-4cb1-9e8a-5171eba7b38f.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">南开大学信息与传播学院推免生申请表.doc</a></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"d673a80e21cf6e28759a8c57eb2c85f4cc93856d02804b8b447d42f2116d516f","textLength":2874,"sourceSha256":"c77f6dac45753d6640b28edfe5d9ce2e00b640ba8ca5594dd6086d4707d94053","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7e56f028905aa35c8e32","title":"2026年南开大学信息与传播学院关于2027年推荐免试硕士研究生预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:05.331050+00:00"}
